      "decision_effect": "changed",
      "card_ids": ["C18", "C08", "C10", "C03", "C22", "C20", "C26", "C09", "C31"]
    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct human absolute oral bioavailability measurement for the query molecule.",
    "No matched oral versus IV exposure data for the query.",
    "Structural similarity to reference contexts is qualitative; no numeric similarity score is available.",
    "Transporter/efflux or first-pass metabolism status of the query is unknown.",
    "Formulation and dose effects on query absorption are unknown."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "Despite a negative physicochemical prior (logD -1.37, TPSA 149), the transferable L1 evidence from structurally related non-aromatic oxygenated polycycles (DHA 45%, hydrocortisone 56–96%, 9-AC ~49%) supports F >= 20%; the only low-F records are from structurally dissimilar or food-affected molecules, so low is not affirmatively supported."
}

